{"title":"Career roadmap · Accounts Executive","role":"Accounts Executive","summary":"An Accounts Executive handles day-to-day accounting operations such as recording transactions, maintaining ledgers, reconciliations, invoicing, taxation support, payables/receivables, and financial reporting. B.Com General is directly aligned with this career.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com General"},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Direct alignment. A practical route is B.Com → Accounts/Finance Intern → Accounts Assistant/Executive → Senior Accounts Executive → Accountant/Finance Analyst."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Master accounting fundamentals, GST/TDS, Excel and accounting software; enter as Accounts Executive"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in taxation, reporting, audit, FP&A, controllership or ERP"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress to Senior Accountant, Finance Manager, Financial Controller or specialist roles"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead finance operations, controllership, FP&A, tax or move toward CFO-track responsibilities"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"Financial accounting, journal, ledger, trial balance"},{"text":"Complete accounting-cycle case"},{"text":"Accounting"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Excel + bookkeeping"},{"text":"Excel, reconciliations, vouchers"},{"text":"Monthly bookkeeping workbook"},{"text":"Digital accounting"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Taxation fundamentals"},{"text":"GST, TDS, income-tax concepts"},{"text":"Tax calculation exercises"},{"text":"Tax"}],[{"text":"Year 